	<text xml:lang="la">
		<body>
			<div xml:id="div1" corresp="regest1">
				<p>
					<s n="1" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z1"/>S.</s>
					<s n="2" xml:lang="la">Narrabit tibi <persName ref="p8455">Voglerus</persName><note xml:id="fn1" type="footnote" ana="bio" n="1"><persName ref="p8455">Hans Vogler d.J.</persName>, der offenbar zwischen <placeName ref="l18">Augsburg</placeName>, <placeName ref="l291">Lindau</placeName> und <placeName ref="l28">Basel</placeName> pendelte; vgl. <bibl source="b22">HBBW XIX</bibl> Reg.; <ref target="file13094">Nr. 3045</ref>; <ref target="file13093">Nr. 3044</ref>. - Vielleicht hatte er eine neue Anstellung bei einer reichen <placeName ref="l18">Augsburger</placeName> Kaufmannsfamilie gefunden; vgl. <bibl source="b19">HBBW XVI</bibl> 192, Anm. 20 (seine Mutter <persName ref="p4248">Apollonia</persName> war eine Angehörige der Familie <persName ref="p20328">Baumgartner</persName>).</note> multa admiranda horrendaque ex <placeName ref="l18">Augusta</placeName>, quae <lb xml:id="p1z2"/>hoc tempore speciem prae se fert plane inferni, istis solis exceptis, quod dęmones <lb xml:id="p1z3"/>illic tripudiant ac venantur.</s>
					<s n="3" xml:lang="la">Ah bone deus, quando tandem finis est mi<lb xml:id="p1z4"/>seriarum, iniuriarum, tyrannidis potentium?</s>
					<s n="4" xml:lang="la">Agunt, quę non decent, tam <lb xml:id="p1z5"/>proterviter, tanto cum damno piorum, ut propemodum incipiant desperare de <lb xml:id="p1z6"/>verbo.<note xml:id="fn2" type="footnote" n="2">Vgl. <ref target="file13144">Nr. 3095</ref>,<ptr target="qvzl17361-3" type="qv"/>.</note></s>
					<s n="5" xml:lang="la"><persName ref="p18538">Cęsar</persName><note xml:id="fn3" type="footnote" n="3"><persName ref="p18538">Karl V.</persName></note> enim <ptr target="fna" type="footnote" n="a"/>adeo immotus<note xml:id="fna" type="footnote" n="a"><hi>Am Rande nachgetragen.</hi></note> antiquis suę religionis insistit vestigiis, ut nemo non possit <lb xml:id="p1z7"/>coniicere, quid animi habeat erga religionem vere christianam, ut boni quique <lb xml:id="p1z8"/>non frustra sibi et verbo timeant.</s>
					<s n="6" xml:lang="la">Nisi ergo dominus propter miseriam et gemi<lb xml:id="p1z9"/>tum pauperum exurgat aliquando,<note xml:id="fn4" type="footnote" n="4">Vgl. <cit type="bible"><ref>Ps 12 (Vulg. 11), 6</ref></cit>.</note> de salute actum <pb type="edition" next="725"/> est nostra, nisi placeat per <lb xml:id="p1z10"/>supplicia mori.</s>
					<s n="7" xml:lang="la">Precandum est itaque iugiter, ut largiatur nobis spiritum sanctum suum, <lb xml:id="p1z11"/>qui nos in fide confirmet, in charitate dirigat,<note xml:id="fn5" type="footnote" n="5">Vgl. <cit type="bible"><ref>Eph 3, 16f</ref></cit>.</note> in patientia corroboret, <lb xml:id="p1z12"/>ne victi hominum crudelitate discedamus a verbo et pereamus.</s>
				</p>
			</div>
			<div xml:id="div2" corresp="regest2">
				<p>
					<s n="8" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z13"/>Porro intelleximus hodie horrenda quędam de <placeName ref="l2448">Quinquepagicis</placeName>, ut videlicet agant, <lb xml:id="p1z14"/>quę sint in detrimentum patrię.</s>
					<s n="9" xml:lang="la">Obstupui sciens, quod, si id verum, actum esset <lb xml:id="p1z15"/>de nobis omnibus (quod intelleximus, non de omnibus sed de privatis quibusd<lb xml:id="p1z16"/>am, imo de oligarchis, id est de iis, qui neque deum neque homines alicuius <lb xml:id="p1z17"/>pensi ęstimant, sed seipsos tantum, accipiendum)!<note xml:id="fnb" type="footnote" n="b"><hi>Klammern ergänzt.</hi></note></s>
					<s n="10" xml:lang="la">Eos tu prae cęteris nosti, quale <lb xml:id="p1z18"/>nempe genus hominum sint.</s>
					<s n="11" xml:lang="la"><persName ref="p4091">Zvinglius</persName> noster propter istos vitam amisit <lb xml:id="p1z19"/>ut Christus propter pharisaeos.</s>
					<s n="12" xml:lang="la">Inter suos blandi sunt, humani, interim <lb xml:id="p1z20"/>et potentes.</s>
					<s n="13" xml:lang="la">Largiuntur quoque caenulas, numos, vestes plebeis<note xml:id="fn6" type="footnote" n="6">Hier substantiviertes Adjektiv.</note>, ut eos habeant, <lb xml:id="p1z21"/>si opus fuerit, adiutores facinorum.</s>
					<s n="14" xml:lang="la">Inde fit, ut sępe conficiant, <lb xml:id="p1z22"/>quę videbantur factu impossibilia.</s>
					<s n="15" xml:lang="la">Timendi sunt igitur, interea tamen <lb xml:id="p1z23"/>et observandi a bonis et prudentibus rerum<note xml:id="fn7" type="footnote" ana="lex" n="7">rerum publicarum.</note> gubernatoribus.</s>
					<s n="16" xml:lang="la">Poterit enim horum <lb xml:id="p1z24"/>cura istorum conatus feliciter praevenire et pessundare.</s>
					<s n="17" xml:lang="la">Quamvis autem ve<lb xml:id="p1z25"/>hementer sit difficile, quod dico, preces tamen perpetuę<note xml:id="fn8" type="footnote" n="8">Vgl. <cit type="bible"><ref>1Thess 5, 17</ref></cit>.</note> adiunctę studiis piis efficient <lb xml:id="p1z26"/>tandem, ut eventus prosperi non possint non sequi.</s>
					<s n="18" xml:lang="la">Velim autem <lb xml:id="p1z27"/>te rogatum per dominum, ut hic me consoleris.</s>
					<s n="19" xml:lang="la">Doleo nanque supra modum, quotie<lb xml:id="p1z28"/>s audio de istis hominibus studia tam prava, utpote contra patriam communem.<note xml:id="fn9" type="footnote" n="9">Dazu konnte nichts Konkretes ermittelt werden. - Vermutlich liegen hier Gerüchte über eine vom Kaiser initiierte Bestechungskampagne vor (vgl. <bibl source="b197">EA</bibl> IV/1d 900 g in fine), was mit dem Versuch der <persName ref="p21145">Habsburger</persName> in Verbindung stehen könnte, die <placeName ref="l862">Eidgenossen</placeName> zu einem neuen Bündnis zu bewegen; s. <ref target="file13111">Nr. 3062</ref>,<ptr target="qvzl17330-7" type="qv"/>; <ref target="file13114">Nr. 3065</ref>,<ptr target="qvzl17331-21" type="qv"/>; <bibl source="b197">EA</bibl> IV/1d 886f k. n; 892 zu n; 898 d; 907 m.</note></s>
					<s n="20" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z29"/>Accidit dein, ut res fiant verisimiles, sicut his diebus vir bonus<note xml:id="fn10" type="footnote" n="10">Unbekannt.</note> mihi <lb xml:id="p1z30"/>narravit auditum ex consiliario intimo<note xml:id="fn11" type="footnote" n="11">Unbekannt.</note> cęsaris, iam maiestatem <lb xml:id="p1z31"/>suam quiescere, quod diviserit confoederatos.</s>
					<s n="21" xml:lang="la">Quod quidem, si verum est?</s>
					<s n="22" xml:lang="la">Quid <lb xml:id="p1z32"/>putas?</s>
					<s n="23" xml:lang="la">Annon habet<note xml:id="fnc" type="footnote" n="c"><hi>Am Rande nachgetragen.</hi></note> Helvetia proditores paratos?</s>
					<s n="24" xml:lang="la">Dominus tantum avertat <lb xml:id="p1z33"/>malum!</s>
					<s n="25" xml:lang="la">Si quid igitur est plausibilius tibi, fac communices, ut vel hac parte <lb xml:id="p1z34"/>possim esse quietior, alioqui nanque tranquillitas non est.</s>
				</p>
			</div>
			<div xml:id="div3" corresp="regest3">
				<p>
					<s n="26" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z35"/>De <placeName ref="l257">Constantiensibus</placeName> fertur lętos esse, ut calamitosi possunt esse lęti, et eos, <lb xml:id="p1z36"/>qui sunt trans lacum<note xml:id="fn12" type="footnote" n="12">Der <placeName ref="l2528">Bodensee</placeName>.</note>, magis conqueri quam ipsos, adeo sunt miseri ac infe<lb xml:id="p1z37"/>lices ob damna, quę patiuntur,<note xml:id="fn13" type="footnote" n="13">Vgl. beispielsweise <ref target="file13138">Nr. 3089</ref>,<ptr target="qvzl17357-5" type="qv"/>; <ref target="file13141">Nr. 3092</ref>,<ptr target="qvzl17362-3" type="qv"/>.</note> dum <placeName ref="l257">Constantia</placeName> premitur interdicto.<note xml:id="fn14" type="footnote" n="14">Das vor Mitte Oktober gegen <placeName ref="l257">Konstanz</placeName> erlassene Mandat; s. <ref target="file13102">Nr. 3053</ref>, <ptr target="qvfn17321-2" type="qv"/>.</note></s>
					<s n="27" xml:lang="la">Aiunt eosdem <lb xml:id="p1z38"/><placeName ref="l257">Constantienses</placeName> conscribere militem, non quidem multum, sed utilem et necessarium.<note xml:id="fn15" type="footnote" n="15">Zu den damaligen Bemühungen <placeName ref="l257">Konstanz</placeName>', eine Stadtgarnison anzuwerben, s. <ref target="file13122">Nr. 3073</ref>,<ptr target="qvzl17339-7" type="qv"/>; <ref target="file13148">Nr. 3099</ref>,<ptr target="qvzl17366-9" type="qv"/>.</note><pb type="edition" next="726"/></s>
				</p>
			</div>
			<div xml:id="div4" corresp="regest4">
				<p>
					<s n="28" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z39"/>Hodie legi literas, in quibus sic erat: „Ad veris tempus cęsar<note xml:id="fnd" type="footnote" n="d"><hi>In der Vorlage</hi> cęsor <hi>(evtl. liegt hier ein Wortspiel vor).</hi></note> invadet <placeName ref="l862">Helvetios</placeName><lb xml:id="p1z40"/>.</s>
					<s n="29" xml:lang="la">Misit idem <persName ref="p3590">landgraphium</persName> <placeName ref="l360">Nordlingam</placeName> non ob aliud, nisi ut <lb xml:id="p1z41"/>peste conficiatur.<note xml:id="fn16" type="footnote" n="16">Laut Christoph von <bibl source="b542">Rommel</bibl> wurde Landgraf <persName ref="p3590">Philipp von Hessen</persName> noch vor der Unterredung mit <persName ref="p18646">Johann von Lier</persName> (s. dazu <ref target="file13148">Nr. 3099</ref>, <ptr target="qvfn17366-3" type="qv"/>) von <placeName ref="l119">Donauwörth</placeName> nach <placeName ref="l360">Nördlingen</placeName> "in eine Herberge, deren Wirth kurz vorher an der Pest gestorben" war, verlegt; s. <bibl source="b542">Rommel</bibl> II 526. - Die Furcht, an der Pest sterben zu müssen, wird auch in den Anfang Dezember verfassten Briefen des Landgrafen thematisiert; s. <bibl source="b443">Moritz von Sachsen PK</bibl> III 662f (<ref target="file10964">Nr. 922</ref>); 668 (<ref target="file10970">Nr. 928</ref>).<ptr target="zfnfn17368-1" type="zfn"/></note></s>
					<s n="30" xml:lang="la">Noluit permittere, ut proprium lectum secum asportaret.</s>
					<s n="31" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z42"/>Irę sunt inter <persName ref="p18250">Mauricium</persName><note xml:id="fn17" type="footnote" n="17">Kurfürst <persName ref="p18250">Moritz von Sachsen</persName>.</note> et <persName ref="p18604">Bavarum</persName><note xml:id="fn18" type="footnote" n="18">Herzog <persName ref="p18604">Wilhelm IV. von Bayern</persName>.</note> graves.“<note xml:id="fn19" type="footnote" n="19">Vermutlich enden hier die dem Brief entnommenen Angaben, da <persName ref="p8418">Myconius</persName> daraufhin mit einem neuen Abschnitt beginnt.</note></s>
				</p>
			</div>
			<div xml:id="div5" corresp="regest5">
				<p>
					<s n="32" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z43"/>Circumfertur aliquot <placeName ref="l875">Hispanos</placeName> per <placeName ref="l2451">Abbacellanos</placeName><note xml:id="fn20" type="footnote" n="20"><placeName ref="l17">Appenzeller</placeName>. - Belegt ist nur, dass sich damals einige <placeName ref="l875">spanische</placeName> Kriegsleute über die <placeName ref="l2697">Alpen</placeName> zurück in den Süden begaben; vgl. <bibl source="b197">EA</bibl> IV/1d 900 k.3.</note> interfectos esse.</s>
					<s n="33" xml:lang="la">Cupio nosse <lb xml:id="p1z44"/>veritatem.</s>
				</p>
			</div>
			<div xml:id="div6" corresp="regest6">
				<p>
					<s n="34" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z45"/><placeName ref="l1273">Ensheimenses</placeName><note xml:id="fn21" type="footnote" n="21">Die vorderösterreichische Regierung in <placeName ref="l1273">Ensisheim</placeName>. - Siehe <ref target="file13148">Nr. 3099</ref>, <ptr target="qvfn17366-2" type="qv"/>.</note> coegerunt pagum<note xml:id="fn22" type="footnote" n="22"><placeName ref="l606">Niederhausen</placeName> (<placeName ref="l2443">Rheinhausen</placeName>, <placeName ref="l2774">Breisgau</placeName>).</note> <placeName ref="l491">Argentinensem</placeName> iurare <persName ref="p18477">Ferdinando</persName>.</s>
					<s n="35" xml:lang="la">Talem pacem <lb xml:id="p1z46"/>illi<note xml:id="fn23" type="footnote" n="23">Die <persName ref="p21145">Habsburger</persName> Brüder Kaiser <persName ref="p18538">Karl V.</persName> und König <persName ref="p18477">Ferdinand I.</persName> - <placeName ref="l491">Straßburg</placeName> hatte nämlich am 21. März 1547 Frieden mit dem Kaiser gemacht; s. <bibl source="b22">HBBW XIX</bibl> 347, Anm. 16.</note> habent!</s>
					<s n="36" xml:lang="la">Querentibus illusit rex: „Quid ad nos, quod pax est inter fratrem <lb xml:id="p1z47"/>et ipsos, cum inter nos et ipsos nulla sit!“</s>
					<s n="37" xml:lang="la">Expende mulieris istius tyran<lb xml:id="p1z48"/>nidem!<note xml:id="fn24" type="footnote" n="24">Vgl. <bibl source="b17">HBBW XIV</bibl> 565,58-60; <ref target="file13068">Nr. 3019</ref>,<ptr target="qvzl17287-2" type="qv"/>; <ref target="file13104">Nr. 3055</ref>,<ptr target="qvzl17323-10" type="qv"/>; <ref target="file13139">Nr. 3090</ref>,[10].</note></s>
					<s n="38" xml:lang="la">Oremus dominum pro tranquillitate.<note xml:id="fn25" type="footnote" n="25">Vgl. <cit type="bible"><ref>1Tim 2, 1f</ref></cit>.</note></s>
				</p>
			</div>
			<div xml:id="div7" corresp="regest7">
				<p>
					<s n="39" xml:lang="la" ana="farewell">Vale in Christo cum <persName ref="p8011">Gval<lb xml:id="p1z49"/>thero</persName> et reliquis.</s>
					<s n="40" xml:lang="la"><placeName ref="l28">Basileę</placeName>, 28. decembris anno 1547.</s>
					<s n="41" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z50"/>O. My<lb xml:id="p1z51"/>.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<note type="address">[Adresse auf der Rückseite:]</note>
					<s n="42" xml:lang="la"><pb/><lb xml:id="p2z1"/>D. <persName ref="p495">Heinricho Bullingero</persName> <lb xml:id="p2z2"/>in domino suo.</s>
					<s n="43" xml:lang="de"><placeName ref="l587">Zü[ric]h</placeName>.<note xml:id="fne" type="footnote" n="e"><hi>Textverlust bei der Entfernung des Siegels.</hi></note></s>
				</p>
			</div>
		</body>
	</text>
</TEI>